# CODEOWNERS — paths that need a named reviewer even when someone else has
# already approved the PR.
#
# GOTCHA: GitHub applies the LAST matching pattern only. A later, broader rule
# silently overrides an earlier, narrower one — so the most specific rules
# belong at the BOTTOM of this file, not the top.

# Default: anything not matched below.
*                               @webamigos/ragen-ai

# CI and the deployment artifact. The image layering rule (AGENTS.md invariant
# 2) is enforced by review, not by a test.
/.github/workflows/             @webamigos/ragen-ai
**/Dockerfile                   @webamigos/ragen-ai

# The invariants themselves, and anything that changes what this repository is
# allowed to contain.
/AGENTS.md                      @patrykomiotek

# Licensing and security policy — single owner on purpose. Any owner listed on
# a line can approve alone, so these stay narrow.
/LICENSE                        @patrykomiotek
/NOTICE                         @patrykomiotek
/SECURITY.md                    @patrykomiotek
/.github/CODEOWNERS             @patrykomiotek
